From: myceliation <myceliation@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:18:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Discover: keep catalog and extras when switching type

When the type changes, look for the selected catalog's counterpart for the new
type (same id, preferring the same add-on) and keep every selected extra the
counterpart also accepts, instead of jumping to the first catalog of that type
with default extras. Falls back to the old behaviour when there's no counterpart.
Applies to every app built on stremio-core.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
